       Extrapolated top = last_top + delta * panel_w / (panel_w - 1), rounded half-up
    5. Build output panel: frame border, fill interior, sprite at extrapolated row
    6. Build input: concatenate num_panels panels sharing border columns, each with sprite
       at top_row + i*delta (i=0..n-1), same local column
